6. **Example Implementations:**
   ```python
   def will_it_fly(q, w):
       if not q:  # Step 1
           return False
       n = len(q)
       for i in range(n // 2):  # Step 2
           if q[i] != q[n - 1 - i]:
               return False
       total_sum = sum(q)  # Step 3
       return total_sum <= w  # Step 4
   ```

